The '''List of emperors of Zong''' covers the imperial rulers of Zong from the proclamation of the [[Jade Empire]] onward. The list currently focuses on the early imperial period associated with the [[Golden Age of Zong]], when the royal court was reorganised around the [[Societal Assembly]] and the imperial succession became a more formalised process.

