| [[Tiancheng of Zong|Emperor Tiancheng]] || c. 1490 || 1521–1560 || None || 1560 || [[House of Yuanlong]] || Oversaw the founding of [[Tamsui]] (1538) and the [[Tamsui Insurgency]] and colonial split (1543) that created the [[Sinchew]] and [[Louyang]] colonies
